  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.26 Service-connected death",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.26 “Service-connected death” means a death:\n\n(a) Suffered while on active duty as established by United States Department of Defense Form 1300 (DD Form 1300); or\n\n(b) Determined by the United States Department of Veterans Affairs to have resulted from an injury, illness, or disability incurred in or aggravated by military service.\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.25)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev400.html"
